    "AI Notes": {
      "value": "Senior, Creative Director level (~10+ yrs). Co-founder and Creative Director at BEEF (beefdesignstudio.com), a NZ brand-identity studio; previously freelance Design Lead at YouTube, and worked at/with Koto, OMSE, Wolff Olins, Pentagram, Stink Studios and Something Special Studios. Specialism: flexible brand systems and digital experiences (his line: systems that know when to misbehave). Work Status Studio: his own site and the BEEF site agree he co-founded and runs BEEF, current. Autonomy 5: runs his own studio and clearly leads projects. Jonathan worked with him on Hebbia, Univers and Cohere and rates him 5; his stated value is cleaning up visual-identity detail and building systems/templates outside web and product. NZ-based, so timezone is the main friction (Jonathan note). Work images are BEEF case studies (Boucles Project, Satina, Iama Ayurveda); his own site is a deliberately minimal landing page. Jonathan body note: works best when the client has very specific requirements and no extra scope.",
